Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.01,0:00:22.34,OPL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}And you don't seem to understand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.01,0:00:22.34,OPL Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Và dường như anh chẳng thể hiểu thấu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.09,0:00:27.54,OPR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}A shame you seemed an honest man
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.09,0:00:27.54,OPR Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thật tiếc thay khi anh từng là người chân thật
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.79,0:00:32.29,OPL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}And all the fears you hold so dear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.79,0:00:32.29,OPL Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Và mọi nỗi sợ anh hằng ôm giữ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:37.56,OPR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Will turn to whisper in your ear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:37.56,OPR Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Sẽ hóa thành lời thì thầm bên tai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.39,0:00:40.96,OPL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}And you know what they say might hurt you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.39,0:00:40.96,OPL Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Anh biết những gì họ nói có thể làm anh tổn thương
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.13,0:00:43.43,OPR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}And you know that it means so much
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.13,0:00:43.43,OPR Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Và anh biết điều đó quan trọng đến nhường nào
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.69,0:00:48.19,OPL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}And you don't even feel a thing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.69,0:00:48.19,OPL Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Nhưng anh thậm chí chẳng cảm nhận được gì
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.89,0:00:53.85,OPR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I am falling, I am fading
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.89,0:00:53.85,OPR Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Tôi đang rơi, tôi đang dần tan biến
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.04,0:00:57.97,OPL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I have lost it all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.04,0:00:57.97,OPL Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Tôi đã đánh mất tất cả
